  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Providing Psychological, Medical, and Reproductive Health Support to Refugees Residing in Sri Lanka</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project will continue IOM&#x2019;s previous interventions to support refugees and asylum seekers residing in Sri Lanka.  Working in coordination with UNHCR and WHO, the project will contribute to improved physical, mental, and social well-being of refugees and asylum seekers through better access to healthcare services, medication, and health risk communication.</narrative>
  </description>
